{"id":"cee81cdd5ec69874","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-decide.md","title":"Turing Machine Decider","display":"df-tm-decide — Turing Machine Decider","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-decide","aliases":["88-df-tm-decide"],"display":"df-tm-decide — Turing Machine Decider","depends_on":["[[88-df-tm-accept]]","[[88-df-tm-language]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-turing-machine]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-decide"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-decide</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-decide — Turing Machine Decider"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c639e2083bc9b76\" href=\"?note=6c639e2083bc9b76\" title=\"88-df-tm-accept\">88-df-tm-accept</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a49d0cae764a2342\" href=\"?note=a49d0cae764a2342\" title=\"88-df-tm-language\">88-df-tm-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> (Turing machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L \\subseteq \\Sigma_M^*\">\\(L \\subseteq \\Sigma_M^*\\)</span> (language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a49d0cae764a2342\" href=\"?note=a49d0cae764a2342\" title=\"88-df-tm-language\">88-df-tm-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\\)</span> (decider predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\\)</span> (halting predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\">\\(\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w)\\)</span> (acceptance predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6c639e2083bc9b76\" href=\"?note=6c639e2083bc9b76\" title=\"88-df-tm-accept\">88-df-tm-accept</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}decide}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land L\\subseteq\\Sigma_M^*\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\\land(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}decide}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decides}_M(L)\n\\leftrightarrow\nM\\in\\mathrm{TM}\n\\land L\\subseteq\\Sigma_M^*\n\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma_M^*\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Halts}_M(w)\\land(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(w))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>判定器对所有输入都终止</li>\n<li>判定器语言是递归集合</li>\n<li>判定器是对每个输入都停机的 Turing 机，而不是计算能力更强的机器模型</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-tm-accept","status":"resol